# The scraper needs no API keys and does not load .env files.
# Configure its limits through `python scrape.py --help`.
# Extraction also needs no API keys: install the local models as described in README.md.
# Embeddings also run locally without keys; download pinned assets with tools/setup_embedding_model.py.
# Query answers are deterministic/extractive, with no generative LLM or API key required.
